          "type": "text",
          "text": "Planning a wedding? Email me here. \n\nInclude your names, your wedding date, the venue or town and a rough guest count. Tell me a little about the day you're planning and attach a link to a mood-board if you've made one. \n\nI'll reply with my packages and we can set up a video call to talk it through.",
